<human_speech><green>Same interface, new habit. You do not have to send everything, every time.<\green><blue>Half the fleet takes a small post. The other half stays to guard home.<\blue><green>And you may pause. Thinking costs the simulation nothing.<\green><blue>Do not tell the operator that, ah, ahem. <\blue><golden><shining>Blotto<\golden><\shining><blue>, proceed.<\blue><\human_speech>
